# AGENTS.md, House conventions: "UTF-8, LF endings." Without this, a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true, the default on windows-latest CI runners and common on Windows
# developer machines) converts every text file to CRLF on disk while the committed blob
# stays LF - agent.md already records the false-failure class this produces for
# prettier --check, and tools/Update-DesignProjection.ps1's LF-only region writes hit the
# same thing: a real run leaves git status non-empty on Windows even though nothing of
# substance changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
